<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sonderbund</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1845–1847</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Sonderbund was a defensive league formed in 1845 by seven Catholic and conservative Swiss cantons, Lucerne, Uri, Schwyz, Unterwalden, Zug, Fribourg and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/valais">Valais</a>, against the liberal and Protestant majority. The federal Diet declared it contrary to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/federal-treaty">Federal Treaty</a> and ordered it dissolved in 1847, and its defeat in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sonderbund-war">Sonderbund War</a> led to the federal constitution of 1848.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/sonderbund.jpg" alt="Sonderbund" width="320" height="205" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Translation by User:Sandstein, original by Marco Zanoli (Sidonius) · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sonderbund_War_Map_English.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
